        "markdown": "# 💡 The Idea\n\nDescribe the idea in one clear sentence.\n\n**Status:** Spark\n\n**Confidence:** Unproven\n\nThis node is the conceptual center of the graph. Everything else explains, tests, challenges, supports, or advances it.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
