        "identity": {
          "graphId": "idea-graph-template"
        },
        "markdown": "## 🎲 Assumptions\n\nWhat must be true for the idea to work?\n\nExamples:\n\n- People experience the stated problem.\n- The proposed behavior is technically possible.\n- The audience will adopt or pay for the solution.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
