        },
        "markdown": "## 🔬 Research\n\nCollect prior art, references, market information, technical findings, links, experiments, and expert opinions.\n\nResearch provides context. It does not automatically prove the idea.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
