      },
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "idea-graph-template"
        },
        "markdown": "## 🚀 Next Steps\n\nDefine the smallest concrete actions that reduce uncertainty or advance the idea.\n\nGood next steps produce evidence:\n\n1. Answer the most important blocking question.\n2. Test the riskiest assumption.\n3. Build the smallest useful prototype.\n4. Promote mature work into a project or task graph.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1785542867665,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e2aadba5-7f06-49c5-909f-4503101e928a",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Relationship Vocabulary",
      "root": false,
      "position": {
        "x": 320,
        "y": 500
      },
      "width": 580,
      "height": 340,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
