      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "idea-graph-template"
        },
        "markdown": "## 🌱 Idea Lifecycle\n\n**Idea → Research → Evidence → Proposal → Project → Tasks → Implementation**\n\nThe graph should grow with the idea rather than forcing the idea to be copied into a new format at every stage.\n\nWhen the next steps become coordinated work, promote them into a dedicated project or task graph.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
